  "content": "<p>(NEXSTAR) – The “Do Not Disturb” sign might not help you much at the following hotels.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>With Halloween nearly here, Tripadvisor has revealed the 10 “most haunted” hotels on its platform, as determined by the volume of user reviews that mention the term “haunted.” Many of the properties on the list also embrace their reputations for alleged paranormal happenings, going so far as to advertise their eerily “active” rooms or spaces as their top attractions.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>That’s certainly the case at the 1886 Crescent Hotel &amp; Spa in Eureka Springs, Arkansas — aka the most  “most haunted” hotel, according to Tripadvisor. The property owners claim there have been <a href=\"https://crescent-hotel.com/blog/ghostly-happenings-at-the-crescent-hotel/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">“hundreds of tales of paranormal experiences”</a> at the hotel, which they attribute (in part) to the building’s former use as a <a href=\"https://www.nwahomepage.com/news/crescent-hotel-in-eureka-springs-named-best-haunted-hotel-in-america/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">cancer hospital.</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>Guests at the hotel can also take advantage of <a href=\"https://crescent-hotel.com/things-to-do/ghosts/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">several ghost-hunting tours,</a> and even a “midnight investigation,” where guests can use “cutting-edge ghost-hunting equipment under the guidance of a paranormal expert.”</p>\n\n\n\n<p>“The ghost tour was fun and my friend got tugged on and I took a suspicious pic so I’m gonna say yes it’s haunted,” one Tripadvisor <a href=\"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g31582-d76931-Reviews-1886_Crescent_Hotel_and_Spa-Eureka_Springs_Arkansas.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">wrote</a> in her five-star review of the hotel.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>If a trip to Arkansas isn’t in the cards anytime soon, Tripadvisor’s list offers plenty of similarly spooky haunts across the country. Coming in at No. 2, for example, is the Stanley Hotel in Estes, Colorado, where novelist Stephen King was staying when he developed the idea for “The Shining.” (The Stanley also offers ghost tours for guests hoping to learn more about the property’s “documented hauntings.”)</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Rounding out the top five on Tripadvisor’s list is the Brickhouse Inn Bed &amp; Breakfast, in Gettysburg, Pennsylvania; the Hotel La More at The Bisbee Inn, in Bisbee, Arizona, and the Andrew Jackson Hotel in New Orleans.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A complete list of the top 10 “haunted” hotels in the U.S., according to Tripadvisor’s analysis of reviews, is below.</p>\n\n\n\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g31582-d76931-Reviews-1886_Crescent_Hotel_and_Spa-Eureka_Springs_Arkansas.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080312911%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=WvRHBR1wCfE9vPPIesYYeGQr%2Bn2jR2RjK29R%2BcFILbE%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">1886 Crescent Hotel &amp; Spa</a> – Eureka Springs, Arkansas</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g60945-d83189-Reviews-Stanley_Hotel-Estes_Park_Colorado.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080323052%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=0nUud7N21qf1cr9%2BMuHtRNNr8r%2FNI44b4RbQDCw%2Fj%2F4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">The Stanley Hotel</a> – Estes Park, Colorado</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g60798-d81435-Reviews-Brickhouse_Inn_Bed_Breakfast-Gettysburg_Pennsylvania.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080333748%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=uC%2F0%2BglaPs%2FQIqFSvK4WkSC00N3YVga%2F%2Ft9APU1g2r8%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Brickhouse Inn Bed &amp; Breakfast</a> – Gettysburg, Pennsylvania</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g31171-d72499-Reviews-Hotel_La_More_at_The_Bisbee_Inn-Bisbee_Arizona.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080344827%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=9BVUrxbQopJNxshhjC0rnbIC9JQ5stMxjDC71iqBY2c%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hotel La More at The Bisbee Inn</a> – Bisbee, Arizona</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g60864-d281614-Reviews-Andrew_Jackson_Hotel-New_Orleans_Louisiana.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080356242%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=xoFugYGrasvh%2F9SMpId0x592wT3%2BxAGbi1BfaiIWwiU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Andrew Jackson Hotel</a> – New Orleans, Louisiana</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g60956-d146143-Reviews-The_Emily_Morgan_San_Antonio_A_Doubletree_By_Hilton_Hotel-San_Antonio_Texas.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080368461%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=n6J8FuysO1gwSeUCk4Yw8ldhK1uk9%2BZHU0pOdtU%2FCAc%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Emily Morgan Hotel – A DoubleTree by Hilton</a> – San Antonio, Texas</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g44354-d111645-Reviews-The_Elms_Hotel_Spa-Excelsior_Springs_Missouri.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080383540%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ZFth5FCyEXo1h0l%2FfUKlG5b6qGqf2eZXuu37h60fRcw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">The Elms Hotel and Spa</a><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g44354-d111645-Reviews-The_Elms_Hotel_Spa-Excelsior_Springs_Missouri.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080397229%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=bIDDQlwTFhW04%2BSP8oMxhpELAsxNmwwKAcWQoFga3%2BE%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"> </a>– Excelsior Springs, Missouri</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g32648-d77621-Reviews-Queen_Mary-Long_Beach_California.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080410842%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=KvhmZZYj2Lpyr9Z9sSjgMGSIMgf58FAH%2FrVS6CrSuG8%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">The Queen Mary</a> – Long Beach, California</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g60814-d86782-Reviews-The_Marshall_House-Savannah_Georgia.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080422164%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=7J%2B2x5ZAWpwzV8k%2F4uD2IErPzSp3V5UMGhi8qS9pDfY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">The Marshall House</a> – Savannah, Georgia</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FHotel_Review-g54946-d97805-Reviews-The_Read_House-Chattanooga_Tennessee.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMBartiromo%40nexstar.tv%7Cd2b7b5efa235417de0c608df3478377c%7C9e5488e2e83844f6886cc7608242767e%7C0%7C0%7C639287363080434614%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=P%2Fa%2B31UKEWvQUh0dURZeAnV2xbWz5mMVySxm6HZUixw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">The Read House</a> – Chattanooga, Tennessee</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p>It’s also worth mentioning that even hotels ranked lower on Tripadvisor’s “haunted” list still promise a spooky stay. San Antonio’s Emily Morgan Hotel heavily suggests that its grounds are <a href=\"https://www.emilymorganhotel.com/happenings/emily-morgan-hotel-americas-most-haunted-hotel/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">haunted by the spirits of those who died at the nearby Alamo,</a> while Chattanooga’s Read House boasts a ghost in Room 311, whom they say is the spirit of a woman “allegedly <a href=\"https://www.thereadhousehotel.com/room-311/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">beheaded in the bathtub</a> by a jealous lover in 1927.”</p>\n\n\n\n<p>“Took the tour of haunted Room 311,” one guest wrote in a May review posted to Tripadvisor, “and I’ve got to tell you, there’s something to it I can’t explain.”</p>"
}
